- Jin-wook!
- Hah?

54
00:04:03.786 --> 00:04:06.079
- Hei, buka pintunya!
- Dimana birku?

55
00:04:06.080 --> 00:04:08.498
- Itu Alex.
- Siapa aku? Keset sialan?

56
00:04:08.499 --> 00:04:10.458
